00:01:01.941 --> 00:01:05.238
what they think of the
Health Nut, Kardashian salad.

00:01:05.238 --> 00:01:08.528
What do you guys feel about Jenner family?

00:01:08.528 --> 00:01:09.451
- They're cool people.

00:01:09.451 --> 00:01:10.284
We love them.

00:01:10.284 --> 00:01:12.344
