Kardashian ass right?

00:01:29.814 --> 00:01:30.647
That's what I've heard.

00:01:30.647 --> 00:01:32.338
- I feel very nerdy that I know this.

00:01:32.338 --> 00:01:35.312
Many of their episodes, you
see them ordering the salad,

00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:37.159
