00:01:37.159 --> 00:01:39.662
If you ever do a Calabasas tour,

00:01:39.662 --> 00:01:41.620
this is the famed Kardashian salad.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.059
- Ben, what do you think of
the Chinese Chicken Salad?

00:01:44.059 --> 00:01:45.724
- It's fine.

00:01:45.724 --> 00:01:46.619
- Oh my God.

00:01:46.619 --> 00:01:47.542
This is delicious.

00:01:47.542 --> 00:01:48.516
- I could eat this whole thing.

00:01:48.516 --> 00:01:49.446
- It's really great.

00:01:49.446 --> 00:01:50.407
- Pretty basic.

00:01:50.407 --> 00:01:51.646
Could get this anywhere.

00:01:51.646 --> 00:01:52.898
- It's a really good salad.

00:01:52.898 --> 00:01:54.409
And the dressing's really light.

00:01:54.409 --> 00:01:55.447
It's not very heavy.

00:01:55.447 --> 00:01:57.828
- Can you see why
Kardashian, Jenner ladies

00:01:57.828 --> 00:01:59.453
are constantly ordering these?

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:00.864
- It's got a lot of protein.

00:02:00.864 --> 00:02:02.298
It's a salad, so it's healthy

00:02:02.298 --> 00:02:03.842
and the dressing's really zesty.

00:02:03.842 --> 00:02:05.996
- I think the bowl style,

00:02:05.996 --> 00:02:08.217
aesthetically pleasing and plastic.

00:02:08.217 --> 00:02:12.221
- My theory is they've been
going here for years, pre-fame.

00:02:12.221 --> 00:02:14.932
- Only part of that life that
they have left to hold onto?

00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:16.522
- I mean, you said it.

00:02:16.522 --> 00:02:17.788
- I could see why they order it

00:02:17.788 --> 00:02:20.192
because they're trying to
keep their physique up.

00:02:20.192 --> 00:02:22.141
I can't see why they would
order this taste-wise.

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:23.994
- I feel like a Kardashian
with this salad.

00:02:23.994 --> 00:02:27.912
- So that was a very full day
of Kardashian, Jenner salads.

00:02:27.912 --> 00:02:30.043
Do you feel like you have gotten a glimpse

00:02:30.043 --> 00:02:32.926
into their lives via vegetables?

00:02:32.926 --> 00:02:34.794
- Honestly, every time I eat a salad now,

00:02:34.794 --> 00:02:37.121
I'm going to think about it and think that

00:02:37.121 --> 00:02:38.804
if it's not the salad we had
today, it's not going to be

00:02:38.804 --> 00:02:40.947
the ultimate Kardashian experience.

00:02:40.947 --> 00:02:43.246
- Yeah I lived vicariously
through a salad.

00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:45.289
- The fact that when you're watching them

00:02:45.289 --> 00:02:48.826
eat the salad, you know
what they are tasting.

00:02:48.826 --> 00:02:51.306
- How many people can say
they experienced that?

00:02:51.306 --> 00:02:52.707
- Not many and I'll say this.

00:02:52.707 --> 00:02:54.233
I'm not a big fan of the Kardashians.

00:02:54.233 --> 00:02:56.631
I don't dislike them
but I don't love them,

00:02:56.631 --> 00:02:58.561
but after having their salads,

00:02:58.561 --> 00:03:00.834
and realizing that it's
not a crazy-ass salad,

00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:02.557
I think they're more
relatable and it makes me

00:03:02.557 --> 00:03:05.257
